    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>To avoid confusion: The top option is the game, the lower option is the <strong>standalone</strong> OST (which does NOT include the game).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search <i>Keyboard Warrior: Dreamstate Prologue</i> to try the game for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/24364254f9b092aeddad28c96f0f2cc8.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weave through enemies and collect crystals to stay alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your character(s) with round-based and meta progression systems to mix and match load-outs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/63e39a32ee1a0f4c4ace0d4593a80d79.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/5130a705561164dd192803ee59cc1237.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/62759cf756bd26ae0d764f4a19297d95.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/d7569163e3d2f878645eb6b6e36f3b6a.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/8171e4ffa0e55179b76997a62c4bd5a1.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through swarms of hungry geometry to emerge victorious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/5ad8cd3e43cdb5d6a7967e721be21ad1.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div>   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/48e52c51b51865f14ef8b43ce8f752e6.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or don't. It's up to you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>To avoid confusion: The top option is the game, the lower option is the <strong>standalone</strong> OST (which does NOT include the game).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search <i>Keyboard Warrior: Dreamstate Prologue</i> to try the game for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/24364254f9b092aeddad28c96f0f2cc8.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weave through enemies and collect crystals to stay alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your character(s) with round-based and meta progression systems to mix and match load-outs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/63e39a32ee1a0f4c4ace0d4593a80d79.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/5130a705561164dd192803ee59cc1237.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/62759cf756bd26ae0d764f4a19297d95.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/d7569163e3d2f878645eb6b6e36f3b6a.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/8171e4ffa0e55179b76997a62c4bd5a1.webp?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through swarms of hungry geometry to emerge victorious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/5ad8cd3e43cdb5d6a7967e721be21ad1.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div>   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076850/extras/48e52c51b51865f14ef8b43ce8f752e6.avif?t=1736731533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or don't. It's up to you.</p>",
